Take your hands off me.

663
00:44:57.120 --> 00:44:58.760
Go back inside.
Take your hands off me!

664
00:44:59.800 --> 00:45:02.216
Go back ins...
I said take your hands off me!

665
00:45:02.240 --> 00:45:04.136
MICHAEL GRUNTS

666
00:45:04.160 --> 00:45:06.416
I'm arresting you
